[metadata]
Name:Day/Night Round Trip with Brutal Cathar
Goal:Win
Turns:6
Difficulty:Medium
Description:End-to-end Day/Night flip exercise. Turn 1: cast Brutal Cathar (Day enters, ETB exiles Llanowar Elves). Turn 2: opp passes (no spells). Turn 3 (our untap): Day->Night flip (opp had 0 casts) — Cathar transforms into Moonrage Brute. Cast Defiant Strike on Cathar twice on turn 3 to push our spell-count to 2. Turn 4 (opp untap): Night->Day flip (we cast 2+ spells last turn) — Cathar transforms back to front face.

